  <entity00266961:GuaranteeDepositsAndOthersRelatedPartyTransactionsOfDisclosureOfOutstandingBalancesOfReceivablesDueFromAndPayablesDueToRelatedPartiesLineItemsOfDisclosureOfOutstandingBalancesOfReceivablesDueFromAndPayablesDueToRelatedPartiesTableOfItems contextRef="PFY2025dFQ_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_ifrs-full_CategoriesOfRelatedPartiesAxis_entity00266961_OtherRelatedPartiesOfAssociatesMemberOfDisclosureOfOutstandingBalancesOfReceivablesDueFromAndPayablesDueToRelatedPartiesTableOfMember" unitRef="KRW" decimals="-3">283936000</entity00266961:GuaranteeDepositsAndOthersRelatedPartyTransactionsOfDisclosureOfOutstandingBalancesOfReceivablesDueFromAndPayablesDueToRelatedPartiesLineItemsOfDisclosureOfOutstandingBalancesOfReceivablesDueFromAndPayablesDueToRelatedPartiesTableOfItems>
